%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'background': '#ffffff'}}}%%
graph LR
    classDef factory fill:#e2e8f0,stroke:#2b6cb0,stroke-width:2px,color:#2b6cb0;
    classDef req fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#276749,stroke-width:1px,color:#1a202c;
    classDef bo fill:#feebc8,stroke:#c05621,stroke-width:2px,color:#7b341e;
    
    S((Server Start)) -->|Load .env| AF[AppContextFactory <br> Singleton Arc]:::factory
    AF -->|Creates Pool| PG[(Postgres Pool)]
    AF -->|Creates Pool| MY[(MySQL Pool)]
    
    C((HTTP Request)) -->|Clones references| RC[RequestContext <br> Temporary Struct]:::req
    PG -.-> RC
    MY -.-> RC
    
    RC -->|Provides pools| BO[Business Object]:::bo
    BO -->|Finishes Execute| D((RAII Zero-Leak Drop))
    
    RC -.-x|Instant Deallocation| D
